# Optional root-level env file for tooling / IDEs.
# The running apps read env from their app folders — see:
#   - apps/server/.env.example  (API + create-admin)
#   - apps/web/.env.example     (Vite; usually empty)

# You can duplicate server vars here if your workflow loads a single root `.env`
# when starting processes from the repo root (then wire your scripts accordingly).

# VPN_MANAGER_MASTER_KEY=AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
# PORT=3000
# DATABASE_PATH=apps/server/data/vpn-manager.sqlite
# STATIC_DIR=apps/web/dist
